From 6820e22c0329ebb23f5cea950f5b5b53394f0304 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:21:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Material properties of the generic-parallel interface:
 version 1 of the functions, as in TFEL

The functions generated by the generic-parallel interface of TFEL for the
material properties are now in version 1 (MFRONT_GPMP_API_VERSION), the
version of the official interface, whose structures are the ones copied
by MGIS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/MGIS/MaterialProperty/BatchMaterialPropertyFctPtr.hxx | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/MGIS/MaterialProperty/BatchMaterialPropertyFctPtr.hxx b/include/MGIS/MaterialProperty/BatchMaterialPropertyFctPtr.hxx
index 7dc094e3..48667b61 100644
--- a/include/MGIS/MaterialProperty/BatchMaterialPropertyFctPtr.hxx
+++ b/include/MGIS/MaterialProperty/BatchMaterialPropertyFctPtr.hxx
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@
  * `TFEL`, with the same members in the same order, so that `MGIS` does not
  * depend on `TFEL` at compile time.
  */
-#define MGIS_MP_GENERIC_PARALLEL_API_VERSION 4
+#define MGIS_MP_GENERIC_PARALLEL_API_VERSION 1
 
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 extern "C" {
-- 
2.43.0

